HYP-3474 COLORED GATE PARTITION-LATTICE AUDIT
status=EVIDENCE / finite quotient-legality scout; not an LRC14 proof
source=HYP-3471 colored gate-reservoir over HYP-3453 survivor-gate/component-cover join

## Assumption Challenge
alternate vertices considered: runners, arcs, raw colors, endpoint kinds,
numeric residues, typed residues, structural sidecars, row-level color
sets, minimum E/branch gates, cover components, and proof obligations.
chosen carrier vertices: row-level quotient fibers in the partition
lattice generated by eight colored-gate axes.
preserved predicate: target-purity of proof-facing row predicates inside
each quotient fiber.
destroyed information: exact interval geometry, owner-current routing,
component adjacency, and row identity unless a color/sidecar axis
explicitly reconstructs it.

## Axis Legend
K=row endpoint-kind set
N=row numeric mod-14 residue set
T=row typed mod-14 residue set
S=row structural sidecar set
F=row full colored-gate set
C=row low-rank gate count profile
M=minimum E/branch structural gate
A=canonical AP84 palette presence bit

