## Theorem-Failure Quotient Note
theorem_failure_bit is identically false on the HYP-3471 bank.
Therefore every quotient preserves the audited implication as a fact of
this bank, but only target-pure quotients preserve the routing data needed
to turn the bank fact into a labelled packet theorem.

