## Proof Pull
The computation suggests a packet theorem target:
  dead-cover obstruction -> minimum E/branch structural gate -> route flags
where the quotient is allowed to forget only after the partition fiber is
pure for the relevant route target, or after a named sidecar reconstructs
the missing coordinate.
Endpoint-kind and numeric-residue quotients are useful scouts, but they
mix route flags heavily.  The minimum E/branch structural gate M is the
smallest single sidecar that sees much of the obstruction skeleton; the
full row-colored gate set F is the strongest finite fingerprint.
